The nominee led Wells Fargo’s pioneering validation of Generative AI models, developing the bank’s first-ever framework for ensuring safe, compliant, and effective GenAI adoption. This included validating a call summarization model used in customer interactions and currently leading the validation of a customer-facing GenAI chatbot. In both cases, the nominee introduced new risk assessment methods where industry standards do not yet exist, establishing the foundation for Wells Fargo’s enterprise-wide GenAI governance.

