4. Describe the innovative methodologies, technologies, or approaches employed by the nominee(s) to achieve these results

The nominee designed and applied novel evaluation techniques tailored to GenAI risks, including:
	•	Hallucination metrics to quantify factual inaccuracy rates.
	•	Summary completeness measures to ensure call summaries captured all key customer and compliance elements.
	•	Explainability assessments to evaluate model transparency and alignment with governance standards.
	•	Robust stress testing against adversarial prompts to safeguard customer-facing chat against harmful, biased, or misleading outputs.
These innovations extended traditional SR 11-7 validation practices into uncharted territory, setting a benchmark for responsible GenAI adoption.

